"<strong>Part {#}: calibrating a {#} MeV layer.</strong> Open Calibrate a {#} MeV layer (PTW {#}). Press Deliver the plan: {#} MU and then Record reading, five times at {#} V with Polarity +; then three times at Polarity −, and three times at {#} V with Polarity +. Export them to the worksheet (the second table), then clear them. Copy the N_D,w certificate (simulated) readout into the factor table. Fill in the factor table as you work down the Calibration steps in the sidebar; type each factor there and press Check to test it.",
